---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Tina Dahl">
  <main class="page about-page">

    <div class="about-image">
      <img
        src="/images/tina.jpg"
        alt="Tina Dahl"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">

      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          I’m Tina. Originally from Norway, I spent over twelve years
          working in hospitality before moving into digital design.
          After years of creating online experiences, I found my way
          back to the physical world through photography and film.
        </p>

        <p>
          Having travelled extensively for more than a decade, I know what
          makes a place memorable. I approach photography and film much like
          I approach design: looking for rhythm, composition, light and the
          details that make something feel considered rather than staged.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-details">
        <p class="about-details-title">A few other things</p>

        <div class="about-detail">
          <span>01</span>
          <p>I designed and made the typeface used throughout this website.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-detail">
          <span>02</span>
          <p>
            I’m a certified sommelier and spent two years writing a wine column,
            travelling to wine regions on press trips along the way.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-detail">
          <span>03</span>
          <p>
            I started and developed an art bar in Oslo, Misfornøyelsesbar (Bemusement bar),
            together with Norwegian artist Christopher Nielsen.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-detail">
          <span>04</span>
          <p>
            My hospitality career started at Norway’s oldest private members’ club,
            where I learned old-school service properly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-detail">
          <span>05</span>
          <p>
            I can code. This website is designed and built by me.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </main>
</Base>
